{
    "title": "Beat Mania: Music Dash Dance",
    "description": "Beat Mania is an exciting free arcade music runner game that offers stunning neon levels and 2024 hit songs. Simply using one thumb to control the character, you slash the rhythm tiles and dodge the traps, reaching the end of the music color road. Become the star in the Cyper Neon Space! \r\n\r\nRunner + music + rhythm = Star!\ud83e\udd18\ud83c\udffc\r\n\r\nHow to play:\r\nSIMPLY choose your favorite song from our massive songs library, hold and drag to move your hero and slash the music tiles on the beat. Do not Tap! This is not a Tap rhythm game.\r\n\r\nKey features: \r\n1.Amazing color and lighting design for every Neon road\r\n2.Free to download and you can play this game offline once you download the songs.\r\n3.Wide range of popular songs including EDM, Hip Hop, KPOP, Dance, and Piano\r\n4.Satisfying music tiles slashing effects",
    "descriptionHTML": "Beat Mania is an exciting free arcade music runner game that offers stunning neon levels and 2024 hit songs. Simply using one thumb to control the character, you slash the rhythm tiles and dodge the traps, reaching the end of the music color road. Become the star in the Cyper Neon Space! <br><br>Runner + music + rhythm = Star!\ud83e\udd18\ud83c\udffc<br><br>How to play:<br>SIMPLY choose your favorite song from our massive songs library, hold and drag to move your hero and slash the music tiles on the beat. Do not Tap! This is not a Tap rhythm game.<br><br>Key features: <br>1.Amazing color and lighting design for every Neon road<br>2.Free to download and you can play this game offline once you download the songs.<br>3.Wide range of popular songs including EDM, Hip Hop, KPOP, Dance, and Piano<br>4.Satisfying music tiles slashing effects",
